tructure."]}, {"figure_index": 7, "page_no": 34, "caption": "", "vlm_descriptions": ["SCIENTIFIC_FIGURE\n\nMulti-panel biological sequence generation figure.\n\nPanel **a**: Schematic workflow with three rows:\n- **Unconditional Generation**: prompt box `RNA,` leads to generated metadata such as “RNA, entelurus aequoreus, tripartite motif-containing protein 16 <seq>”, then to generated sequence containing tokens like `<seq><gene>` and nucleotide text.\n- **Species-specific Generation**: prompt `RNA, Homo sapiens,` leads to generated human metadata for `cdc42bpa, serine/threonine-protein kinase mrck alpha isoform 1 <seq>`, then generated sequence.\n- **Downstream Task Generation**: prompt `RNA, histone H1<seq>` directly leads to generated sequence with `<gene>`, `<cds>`, and nucleotide sequence tokens.\n\nPanels **b** and **c**: Scatterplots comparing generated sequences by:\n- x-axis: **BLAST Bit Score (Sequence Quality)**\n- y-axis: **Semantic Similarity**\n- marginal histograms on top and right\n- colored point clouds with trend curves\n- annotations:\n  - panel b: Spearman rho = 0.32, mean similarity = 0.79\n  - panel c: Spearman rho = 0.43, mean similarity = 0.70\n\nPanel **d**: Density plots comparing **Real Genome** and **Generated Sequences** distributions:\n- top: **CDS GC Content (%)**\n- bottom: **CDS GC3 Content (%)**\nGenerated sequences appear shifted toward higher GC and GC3 content than real genome distributions.\n\nPanel **e**: Boxplots comparing generated CDS nucleotide composition across species, with star markers for real genome values:\n- species: Human, Zebrafish, Fruit Fly, Arabidopsis, Yeast, Maize\n- top y-axis: **CDS GC Content (%)**\n- bottom y-axis: **CDS GC3 Content (%)**\n\nPanel **f**: Polar/radar-style codon usage plots for:\n- Human\n- Zebrafish\n- Fruit Fly\n- Arabidopsis\n- Yeast\n- Maize  \nEach compares real genome codon patterns against generated sequence patterns.\n\nPanel **g**: Amino acid frequency bar charts for the same six 